  "notes": {
    "wrist": "This sculpt ships with closed fists, so the wrist girth scan finds no knuckle bulge on the left arm and falls back to 0.72 -- 13% off its own right arm, which did resolve. 0.85 is the right arm's measured value and Carney's on both sides. With the override, wristSkew drops from 13.49% to 0.16%.",
    "guard": "Re-swept for this sculpt. Its arms are 0.354 of height against the previous Trump's ~0.42, so the old targets sat past the right arm's reach and locked it straight (94% extension). The rear hand is the constrained one: pulling it in to a 65% extension buries the elbow in the belly, so 78% with 0.08 m of clearance is the trade this figure actually allows."
